 "dialogue": [
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "The Sawyers live at 87 King Street.",
   "zh": "索耶一家住在国王街 87 号。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L055.mp4",
    "start": 7,
    "end": 12.2
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "In the morning, Mr. Sawyer goes to work and the children go to school.",
   "zh": "早上，索耶先生去上班，孩子们去上学。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L055.mp4",
    "start": 12.2,
    "end": 19.3
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "Their father takes them to school every day.",
   "zh": "父亲每天送孩子们去上学。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L055.mp4",
    "start": 19.3,
    "end": 23.5
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "Mrs. Sawyer stays at home every day.",
   "zh": "索耶夫人每天呆在家里。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L055.mp4",
    "start": 23.5,
    "end": 27.2
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "She does the housework.",
   "zh": "她料理家务。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L055.mp4",
    "start": 27.2,
    "end": 30.1
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "She always eats her lunch at noon.",
   "zh": "她总是在正午吃午饭。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L055.mp4",
    "start": 30.1,
    "end": 34.2
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "In the afternoon, she usually sees her friends.",
   "zh": "下午，她总是会见她的朋友。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L055.mp4",
    "start": 34.2,
    "end": 39.6
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "They often drink tea together.",
   "zh": "她们经常在一起喝茶。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L055.mp4",
    "start": 39.6,
    "end": 43
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "In the evening, the children come home from school.",
   "zh": "傍晚，孩子们放学回家。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L055.mp4",
    "start": 43,
    "end": 47.4
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "They arrive home early.",
   "zh": "他们到家很早。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L055.mp4",
    "start": 47.4,
    "end": 50.6
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "Mr. Sawyer comes home from work.",
   "zh": "索耶先生下班回家。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L055.mp4",
    "start": 50.6,
    "end": 54.2
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "He arrives home late.",
   "zh": "他到家很晚。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L055.mp4",
    "start": 54.2,
    "end": 57.6
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "At night, the children always do their homework.",
   "zh": "晚上，孩子们总是做作业，",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L055.mp4",
    "start": 57.6,
    "end": 62.7
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "Then they go to bed.",
   "zh": "然后去睡觉。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L055.mp4",
    "start": 62.7,
    "end": 64.9
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "Mr. Sawyer usually reads his newspaper,",
   "zh": "索耶先生总是读报纸，",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L055.mp4",
    "start": 64.9,
    "end": 69.6
   }
  },
  {
